              "type": "text",
              "variant": "paragraph",
              "atoms": [
                {
                  "id": "#abody2",
                  "kind": "literal",
                  "text": "The second concentration is behind the coastal tie. Nothing there has been derated, but the tie has carried an unplanned outage in each of the last three winters and the spares position for its breakers is one deep. That is a different kind of risk from the first and does not respond to the same money."
                }
              ],
              "display": "The second concentration is behind the coastal tie. Nothing there has been derated, but the tie has carried an unplanned outage in each of the last three winters and the spares position for its breakers is one deep. That is a different kind of risk from the first and does not respond to the same money.",
